---
import Prose from '../layouts/Prose.astro';
import release from '../data/release.json';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
const repo = 'https://github.com/ibrahemid/writ';
---
<Prose title="Press kit" description="Name, one-line description, icon files, screenshots and facts about Writ for articles and listings." path="/press/" lead="What is needed to write about Writ accurately, in one place.">
  <h2>The facts</h2>
  <table>
    <tbody>
    <tr><td>Name</td><td>Writ. Capital W, no article, never "Writ app".</td></tr>
    <tr><td>One line</td><td>Light text editor for any text file, with full-text search and inline Markdown.</td></tr>
    <tr><td>What it does</td><td>Opens any text file and saves it where it is. Searches every file in its folder by name and by content. A Markdown file is formatted as you type, with the markup shown on the line being edited. One hotkey brings the window over any app. Connections, a graph, tags, chat, rewriting and an MCP server for other programs are apps, each switched on in Settings.</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Platforms</td><td>macOS 12+, Windows 10+, Linux (x86_64).</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Price and license</td><td>Free. Open source under MIT.</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Current version</td><td>{release.version}, released {release.publishedAt.slice(0, 10)}.</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Public since</td><td>April 2026. Source, decision records and release history at <a href={repo}>github.com/ibrahemid/writ</a>.</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Made by</td><td>Ibrahem (ibrahemid on GitHub), one person.</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Built with</td><td>Rust and Tauri 2 for the shell; SolidJS and CodeMirror 6 for the editor; SQLite for the index.</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Privacy</td><td>No account, no telemetry. The first send to any AI host and the first call from any program wait for the user's approval.</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Contact</td><td><a href="mailto:ibrahemid@gmail.com">ibrahemid@gmail.com</a></td></tr>
  </tbody>
  </table>
  <h2>Icon and share image</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href={`${base}/brand/icon-256.png`} download>icon-256.png</a></li>
    <li><a href={`${base}/brand/icon-128.png`} download>icon-128.png</a></li>
    <li><a href={`${base}/brand/og-1-0.png`} download>og-1-0.png</a>, 1200 by 630</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Use the icon on its own, unrotated, on any background. Do not recolor it or set it inside another shape.</p>
  <h2>Screenshots</h2>
  <p>Captures of the real app at 2x are in the repo under <a href={`${repo}/tree/main/docs/media`}>docs/media</a> and <a href={`${repo}/tree/main/docs/design`}>docs/design</a>. Take your own freely; the window is the product.</p>
  <h2>How to describe it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>A text app. Markdown is one of the formats it opens, and chat, the graph and the MCP server are apps a user switches on.</li>
    <li>Desktop only, with no plugins, mobile app or sync.</li>
    <li>No performance numbers have been published. Please do not cite one.</li>
  </ul>
</Prose>
